# blocks/scan_mid - the 0 y-level of the 7x7x3 utility-block sweep around a player.
# This was one 147-line file (blocks/scan) that ran all three levels on the same
# tick. Split into three files, one per 10-tick phase of the tick cycle, so a
# player costs 49 block checks per scan instead of 147. Same coverage, same
# detection delay (<=1s), a third of the peak cost per tick.
